# Copy this file to .env.secrets and fill in real values.
# .env.secrets is gitignored and overrides configs/homepage/.env.
# Empty: every credential homepage's widgets need is supplied as a compose
# secret and read via HOMEPAGE_FILE_* variables, which point at mounted files
# rather than holding values. See docker-compose-proxy.yml and
# services.yaml's {{HOMEPAGE_FILE_...}} placeholders.
